#: of publish.run_command:1
msgid "Runs a shell command and exits if it fails."
msgstr ""
"```python\n"
"import subprocess\n"
"\n"
"def run_command(cmd):\n"
"    try:\n"
"        subprocess.check_call(cmd)\n"
"    except subprocess.CalledProcessError as e:\n"
"        print(f\"Command failed with return code {e.returncode}\")\n"
"```\n"
" \n"
"Note: The above is written in Python, however you can easily adapt this to other languages."

#: ../../source/publish.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "**参数**"

#: of publish.run_command:3
msgid "The shell command to run."
msgstr "执行 Shell 命令"

#: of publish.run_command:4
msgid "Optional error message to display on failure."
msgstr ""
"**错误提示**\n"
" \n"
"失败时可显示的选项性提示 messages。"

